<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Selfcare said started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Selfcare said started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Bros started Selfcare Inc with an outperform rating, according to a market source.</p>
<p>-- Selfcare shares edged up 1/8 to 14-3/4 in early trading Friday.</p>
</text>
